@startuml
title Provider 异常的包装、传输与重新抛出

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "Consumer 业务代码" as Consumer
participant "InvokerInvocationHandler" as Proxy
participant "Provider 业务方法" as Business
participant "AbstractProxyInvoker" as ProviderInvoker
participant "ExceptionFilter" as Filter
participant "DubboCodec" as Codec
participant "DefaultFuture" as Future
participant "RpcResult" as Result

Consumer -> Proxy: service.method()
Proxy -> Business: 远程调用
Business --> ProviderInvoker: 抛出业务异常
ProviderInvoker -> ProviderInvoker: 捕获 InvocationTargetException
ProviderInvoker -> Result: new RpcResult(targetException)
Result -> Filter: 返回含异常的 Result

alt 已声明 / 可安全传输的异常
  Filter --> Codec: 保留原异常
else 未声明且异常类可能不在 Consumer
  Filter -> Filter: Provider 记录错误日志
  Filter --> Codec: 包装为 RuntimeException(异常文本)
end

Codec -> Codec: RESPONSE_WITH_EXCEPTION\n并序列化 Throwable
Codec --> Future: Response(requestId)
Future --> Proxy: RpcResult
Proxy -> Result: recreate()
Result --> Consumer: 在 Consumer 调用栈重新抛出异常
@enduml
